<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">TEMPLE OF SETHRALISS · MYTHIC+ · ELEMENTAL SHAMAN</div>
    <h1><span class="cls">元素萨满</span><span class="dot">·</span>塞塔里斯神庙 应对手册</h1>
    <p class="lede">塞塔里斯神庙兼具<b>高额物理重击</b>与<b>持续自然/暗影掉血</b>。元素萨满没有免疫，靠 90 秒<b>星界转移</b>按路线预留高压点：开场震地、双首领电闪雷鸣、蝰蛇区锯齿冲锋流血、暴怒云气释放电荷、加瓦兹特挡光束（镀流）、宝珠区蚀骨践踏与尾王吃球腐化；<b>清毒图腾</b>清蝰蛇区细胞毒素，<b>净化术</b>驱云气积攒电荷，<b>妖术</b>控宝珠走廊神庙干扰者，<b>土元素</b>（3 分钟）补星界空档。</p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">参考 <b>+24 限时元素萨满（国 / 欧 / 韩）</b></span>
      <span class="chip">英雄天赋 <b>先知</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="nav" aria-label="阶段导航">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nav-scroll">
      <a href="#prep" class="on">速记</a>
      <a href="#timeline">时间轴</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#s1">开场</a>
      <a href="#s2"><span class="n">①</span>双首领</a>
      <a href="#s3">蝰蛇区</a>
      <a href="#s4"><span class="n">②</span>米利克萨</a>
      <a href="#s5">暴怒云气</a>
      <a href="#s6"><span class="n">③</span>加瓦兹特</a>
      <a href="#s7">宝珠区</a>
      <a href="#s8"><span class="n">④</span>化身</a>
      <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <a href="#talent">天赋</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

<section id="prep">
  <h2><span class="k">00</span>开打前速记</h2>
  <p class="sub">四张手牌管住全本，外加一条机制硬限制与四个必断读条。</p>

  <div class="cores">
    <article class="core main">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:108271}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">星界转移</div><div class="cd">90 秒（位面旅行者）· 持续 12 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>所有伤害 −40%。全本唯一主动大减伤，按路线固定点预留，两波间隔不足 90 秒时优先保后面那波。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:198103}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">土元素</div><div class="cd">3 分钟 · 持续 30 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>配始源羁绊不再嘲讽，改为最大生命值 +15%。满 3 分钟专门补星界空档：开场二轮震地、释放电荷与蚀骨践踏。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:383013}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">清毒图腾</div><div class="cd">2 分钟 · 持续 6 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>每 1.5 秒清 30 码内一名队友全部中毒。专治蝰蛇区细胞毒素，不能清非中毒自然持续伤。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:57994}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">风剪</div><div class="cd">12 秒 · 风幕：受到法伤 −15%</div></div></div>
      <p>打断后 12 秒受法术伤害 −15%（震地与锯齿冲锋是物理，吃不到）。盯紧下方四个必断读条。</p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="limit">
    <div class="h">没有免疫 · 认清物理伤与非中毒自然伤</div>
    <b>震地</b>与<b>锯齿冲锋流血</b>均为物理伤害，风幕减不了；<b>毒蛇风暴</b>与<b>蚀骨践踏</b>没有中毒标签，清毒图腾驱不掉。<b>镀流</b>（加瓦兹特光束）与<b>腐化</b>（尾王吃球，另使造成的治疗 −33%）均带 <b>+250% 物理易伤</b>，身上带层时绝不碰小怪近战。
  </div>

  <div class="kicks-box">
    <div class="kicks-head">
      <img class="ic" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="风剪">
      <h3>全本必断读条</h3>
      <span>点击跳到对应战斗</span>
    </div>
    <div class="kicks">
      <a class="kick" href="#k-bolt">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">01</span><span>风暴能手 / 唤雷者 · 开场 / 云气段</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">闪电箭</div>
        <div class="why">2.5 秒读条单体自然重击，全程第一高频轮断并续风幕。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-venom">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">02</span><span>育巢者 · 蝰蛇区</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">毒箭</div>
        <div class="why">2.5 秒读条单体自然重击，漏断撞上流血直接倒人。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-spit">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">03</span><span>剧毒蝰蛇 · 蝰蛇区 / 米利克萨</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">毒素喷吐</div>
        <div class="why">4 秒读条，漏断直击并挂 8 秒中毒，风剪必断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-flame">
        <div class="meta"><span class="idx">04</span><span>扭曲的妖术师 · 尾王门前 / 化身</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">烈焰震击</div>
        <div class="why">4 秒读条高伤火焰加 8 秒跳伤，进波焦点必断。</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="timeline">
  <h2><span class="k">01</span>一场里减伤和清毒交在哪</h2>
  <p class="sub">一场 +24 限时实录（展示真实冷却节奏，非每波强制照搬；具体取舍见下方路线）。</p>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-scroll">
{{TIMELINE}}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i class="pri"></i>星界转移 · 固定点</span>
      <span><i class="e"></i>土元素</span>
      <span><i class="v"></i>清毒图腾</span>
      <span><i class="boss"></i>首领战</span>
      <span><i class="trash"></i>小怪段</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="route">
  <h2><span class="k">02</span>按路线逐段</h2>
  <p class="sub">看到什么 → 按什么 → 为什么。带「必做」标签的高亮行是每把必做的关键动作。伤害数字是 +24 实测（含被吸收的部分），层数越高越大。</p>

  <div class="route">

    <!-- 开场 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s1">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>开场 → 阿斯匹克斯 / 阿德里斯</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 沙怒石拳战士 / 风暴能手 / 流沙猎手 / 隐秘之牙 / 倒刺三叶虫</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>两只石拳战士成对读<b>震地</b>（约 30 秒一轮）。星界保首轮，二轮满 3 分钟交<b>土元素</b>撑血，双牌都空喊治疗；已约定首轮吃保护祝福时顺延星界。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:265966}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>震地</div><div class="s">沙怒石拳战士 4 秒读条 · 60 码全团物理 + 击退</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">二轮</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条后半开星界可同盖两只；二轮满 3 分钟召土元素拉高血上限，双空喊治疗并防击退引怪。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-bolt">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1291262}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">闪电箭</div><div class="s">风暴能手 2.5 秒读条 · 单体自然约 68 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">本段第一必断，顺手续 12 秒风幕；漏断撞上蜿蜒打击极易减员。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1308113}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">箭雨 / 蜿蜒打击</div><div class="s">流沙猎手 9 秒连射物理 / 隐秘之牙瞬移自然约 38 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">群体硬控停</span><span class="or">或</span><span class="act-note">靠治疗刷</span></div>
            <div class="why">箭雨常规打断断不了，用硬控停；躲 5 码沙爆箭，三叶虫锯齿冲锋流血同蝰蛇区。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">震地每次吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">96.5 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:54%">51.7 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界交首轮震地，满 3 分钟土元素撑二轮</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s2">下一段：双首领 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 1 双首领 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s2">
      <div class="node">1</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>阿斯匹克斯 / 阿德里斯</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 1 · 双首领</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>约 <b>48 秒</b>一轮：狂风之力 → 电闪雷鸣 → 暴风。星界转移隔轮（满 90 秒）交<b>电闪雷鸣</b>；有<b>风暴祝福</b>的一侧免疫伤害，打非免疫侧压匀血防早进狂乱。门前小怪常连带进战，优先断闪电箭、留神三叶虫流血。</div>
        <div class="subhead">一轮电闪雷鸣（以电闪雷鸣开始读条为 0 秒）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">0 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1288087}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">电闪雷鸣（开始读条）</div><div class="s">阿德里斯 4.5 秒读条 · 8 码均摊自然</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="act-note">集合进 8 码</span></div>
            <div class="why">满 90 秒在<b>电闪雷鸣读条期间</b>开星界；冷却轮满血分摊靠风幕与治疗。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">约 +4.8 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1288092}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">冲刺落地 → 惊雷退场</div><div class="s">均摊约 53 万（星界约 33 万）→ 冲刺后约 5 秒 20 码惊雷</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">立刻撤出 20 码</span></div>
            <div class="why">吃下冲刺立刻撤出 20 码，冲刺后约 5 秒惊雷近身约 220 万秒杀，别贪读条。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">穿插</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1310712}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">狂风之力 / 暴风 / 阵风</div><div class="s">全团击退约 45 万 / 8 码沉默风区 / 4 秒高频自然持续</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">贴边放风，靠治疗刷</span></div>
            <div class="why">狂风之力背靠安全区防被吹进沉默圈；暴风贴边放；阵风高频掉血靠治疗与风幕。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：满 90 秒隔轮星界交电闪雷鸣，分摊完立刻退 20 码</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s3">下一段：蝰蛇区 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 老一到老二小怪：蝰蛇区 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s3">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>双首领 → 米利克萨（蝰蛇区）</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 倒刺三叶虫 / 剧毒蝰蛇 / 育巢者 / 砂誓骑兵 / 闪电毒蛇 / 无信征服者</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span>锯齿冲锋流血与细胞毒素叠加极易倒人。<b>星界转移（90 秒）交锯齿冲锋流血</b>，<b>清毒图腾（2 分钟）专清细胞毒素</b>；后面米利克萨无必留点，本段放心按冷却交牌。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1291399}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>锯齿冲锋</div><div class="s">倒刺三叶虫瞬发冲锋 · 直击约 40 万 + 6 秒物理流血</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">被冲上流血后立刻补开（物理吃不到风幕），顺带压住叠上的细胞毒素；冷却时喊治疗重点刷。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1308148}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>细胞毒素</div><div class="s">剧毒蝰蛇瞬发中毒 · 直击约 39 万 + 10 秒跳伤约 19 万/秒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:383013}}" alt="">清毒图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">上毒后立刻插人群，6 秒连续清队内中毒；图腾冷却时喊治疗驱散或借星界顶住。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-venom">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1310683}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒箭</div><div class="s">育巢者 2.5 秒读条 · 单体自然重击</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why">进波焦点必断，避免和冲锋流血同刻秒人。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-spit">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:267027}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒素喷吐</div><div class="s">剧毒蝰蛇 4 秒读条 · 单体自然 + 8 秒中毒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span></div>
            <div class="why"><b>队友专断无信征服者扰乱心智</b>（与读条时间冲突），风剪专盯毒箭与毒素喷吐。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:272655}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">黄沙冲刷 / 毒蛇唤雷</div><div class="s">骑兵 4.5 秒锥形迷惑 / 闪电毒蛇 8 秒后脚下留电池</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">躲锥形，远离电池</span></div>
            <div class="why">躲开骑兵头前锥形防被迷惑 4 秒；远离闪电毒蛇留下的萦绕风暴与三叶虫群。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">锯齿冲锋每跳流血吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">26.1 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:59%">15.4 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界压冲锋流血，清毒图腾清细胞毒素</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s4">下一段：米利克萨 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 2 米利克萨 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s4">
      <div class="node">2</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>米利克萨</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 2</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>约 <b>100 秒</b>大循环（以开打为 0 秒）：缠绕蛇群 +13 秒 → 雷霆喷吐 +25 秒 → 毒蛇风暴 +36 秒 → 钻地 +49 秒（持续约 50 秒）。<b>本战无必留星界点</b>，把星界与土元素留给后面的暴怒云气。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1290030}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">缠绕蛇群</div><div class="s">点名 4 秒后昏迷 · 每秒物理约 18 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">贴近人群让队友秒打</span><span class="or">备选</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:192058}}" alt="">电能图腾</span></div>
            <div class="why">被点靠人群让队友集火或群控救；备选提前在脚下插电能图腾借 2 秒延迟昏迷自救。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1289109}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">雷霆喷吐</div><div class="s">点名 3.5 秒后连劈 4 下（约 34 万/下）· 留电池</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:79206}}" alt="">灵魂行者的恩赐</span><span class="act-note">贴边排电池</span></div>
            <div class="why">被点立刻开移动施法，贴场地边缘连续排开萦绕风暴，不留中场。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1293048}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒蛇风暴</div><div class="s">4 秒读条击退约 60 万 + 8 秒自然持续约 15 万/秒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">靠治疗刷，躲风暴打击</span></div>
            <div class="why">非中毒，清毒图腾驱不了；背靠安全区防被吹进电池，血线危急再交星界兜底。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300227}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">钻地 → 钻地之震</div><div class="s">钻地约 50 秒 · 全团每秒约 10 万 + 刷剧毒蝰蛇</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span><span class="act-note">躲钻地路径与小蛇</span></div>
            <div class="why">躲钻地撞击（击飞晕 4 秒），<b>快清钻地小怪促出地</b>，风剪盯断剧毒蝰蛇的毒素喷吐。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:79206}}" alt="">优先：灵魂行者的恩赐排雷霆喷吐，星界留给暴怒云气</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s5">下一段：暴怒云气 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 老二到老三小怪：暴怒云气 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s5">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>米利克萨 → 加瓦兹特（暴怒云气）</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 暴怒云气 / 灌注能量的唤雷者 / 静电充能</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span>暴怒云气叠<b>积攒电荷</b>后读<b>释放电荷</b>全团重击。<b>净化术盯驱电荷增益</b>，星界转移（90 秒）预开顶释放电荷，空档满 3 分钟交<b>土元素</b>；末波距自己进加瓦兹特挡束 ≥ 90 秒再交星界。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1293475}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>释放电荷</div><div class="s">暴怒云气 3 秒读条 · 全团自然重击</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">空档</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条末提前约 1 秒开星界，同减火花步；无星界轮满 3 分钟交土元素，同时躲 6 码召唤闪电。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1310739}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">积攒电荷</div><div class="s">暴怒云气 1.5 秒读条 · 魔法增益 +8%/层（最多 3 层）</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:370}}" alt="">净化术</span></div>
            <div class="why">叠上立刻用净化术（或强效净化术）驱净，削弱随后的释放电荷，并躲好 6 码召唤闪电。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:264763}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">火花步 / 灌能传导</div><div class="s">静电充能 5 码溅射约 29 万 / 唤雷者 20 秒魔法持续</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">5 码分散，喊治疗驱</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">断闪电箭</span></div>
            <div class="why">保持 5 码分散少吃火花步；灌能传导结束会击晕，喊治疗秒驱，顺断唤雷者闪电箭。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">释放电荷每次吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">75.3 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:60%">45.1 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:370}}" alt="">优先：净化术清电荷，星界与土元素错开吃释放电荷</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s6">下一段：加瓦兹特 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 3 加瓦兹特 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s6">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>加瓦兹特</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>开打约 +10 秒出全队首波三束，<b>+21 秒</b>起每 <b>23 秒</b>一次<b>诱导</b>（约 80 万）并穿插光束。三束各派人守，<b>星界转移专留自己挡束（镀流）</b>，未转好按分工换人接；诱导靠治疗抬满硬吃。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:266923}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>镀流（拦截尖塔光束）</div><div class="s">每 0.5 秒自然跳伤 + 物理易伤 250% · 漏挡满 100 能量放电叠电容</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why"><b>进线即开星界</b>压住十余跳（分工和血线稳时可单挡）；首束或冷却轮按分工换手，绝不空线。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1290531}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">诱导 → 诱导力场</div><div class="s">每 23 秒 3 秒读条 · 全团自然约 80 万 + 留 1 分钟静电场</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">满血硬吃，撤出电圈</span></div>
            <div class="why">星界留给镀流，诱导前等治疗抬满，落地立刻走离静电场防白吃跳伤。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">镀流每 0.5 秒吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">15.1 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:62%">9.3 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：星界全交镀流（满 90 秒 2–3 次），首束未好先轮挡</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s7">下一段：宝珠区 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 老三到老四小怪：宝珠区 -->
    <article class="stop trash" id="s7">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>加瓦兹特 → 塞塔里斯的化身（宝珠区）</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 宝珠守望者 / 神庙干扰者 / 塞塔里斯之眼 / 无信折磨者 / 扭曲的妖术师</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>护送塞塔里斯之眼开尾王门。<b>妖术控制两只神庙干扰者</b>；<b>星界转移（90 秒）交蚀骨践踏</b>，空档满 3 分钟交<b>土元素</b>，双牌都空喊治疗；尾王首球约 +38–48 秒刷，按自己预计接球满 90 秒提前留星界。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1303486}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">蚀骨践踏</div><div class="s">宝珠守望者 3.5 秒读条 · 60 码直击约 64 万 + 10 秒自然持续</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span><span class="or">空档</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:198103}}" alt="">土元素</span></div>
            <div class="why">非中毒，清毒图腾驱不了；读条末开星界同压直击（约 36 万）与跳伤（约 11 万），满 3 分钟土元素补直击或跳伤，双空喊治疗。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:51514}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">神庙干扰者</div><div class="s">走廊人型怪 · 干扰搬运塞塔里斯之眼</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:51514}}" alt="">妖术</span></div>
            <div class="why">搬球经过前顺手妖术场边干扰者（常规控两只），控住别打醒。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1303596}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">能量虹吸 / 火花之墙</div><div class="s">离宝珠最近者每秒约 25 万 / 躲火花墙与极化减速圈</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">拉开宝珠距离，避开火花墙</span></div>
            <div class="why">把能量虹吸让给护球位或坦克，别碰火花墙；门前妖术师按尾王规则断烈焰震击。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:51514}}" alt="">优先：妖术控两只干扰者，星界与土元素错开顶蚀骨践踏</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s8">下一段：塞塔里斯的化身 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- 首领 4 塞塔里斯的化身 -->
    <article class="stop boss" id="s8">
      <div class="node">4</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>塞塔里斯的化身</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 4</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>两波净化循环（约 +15 秒 / +120 秒刷精华污染者，<b>+40 秒 / +150 秒刷腐蚀生命力球</b>）。按接球时距上次开星界满 90 秒各交一次，未转好提前换人接或喊治疗；先秒污染者，腐化退后再帮刷化身。</div>
        <div class="subhead">两波净化节奏（以开打为 0 秒）</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">+15 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1301199}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">精华污染者 / 堕落的守护者</div><div class="s">污染之秽禁疗化身 · 守护者邪恶冲锋 8 秒暗影约 22 万/秒</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">秒杀污染者，顺劈折磨者</span></div>
            <div class="why">先秒污染者解除禁疗，同步清无信折磨者（锁定追治疗每层降疗 5%）；邪恶冲锋靠治疗刷。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step" id="k-flame">
            <div class="when">穿插</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1302158}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">烈焰震击 / 潜藏妖术</div><div class="s">扭曲的妖术师 4 秒火焰读条 / 潜藏妖术点治疗（炸 10 码留泥）</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:57994}}" alt="">风剪</span><span class="act-note">远离治疗 10 码</span></div>
            <div class="why"><b>风剪必断烈焰震击</b>；远离治疗 10 码防吃潜藏妖术爆炸，绝不踩青蛙泥。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">+40 / +150 秒</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1312214}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>腐蚀生命力 → 腐化</div><div class="s">触球净化化身 · 15 秒暗影持续 + 造成的治疗 −33% + 物理易伤 250%（可叠）</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">星界转移</span></div>
            <div class="why">按分工吃球（漏吃 6 秒炸团），<b>触球即开星界压前段</b>，末段靠治疗；易伤期绝不沾小怪近战。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">清波后</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:8004}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">化身可治疗窗口</div><div class="s">污染者倒下后即可抬满塞塔里斯的化身</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:8004}}" alt="">治疗之涌</span><span class="tgt">给化身</span></div>
            <div class="why">污染者倒下且<b>腐化消退后</b>（避开 −33% 降疗），顺手读治疗之涌帮抬满化身收尾。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="subhead">腐化每秒吃多少</div>
        <div class="bars">
          <div class="bar-row"><span>不开</span><div class="bar"><span class="off" style="width:100%">23.4 万</span></div></div>
          <div class="bar-row"><span>星界转移</span><div class="bar"><span class="mid" style="width:57%">13.3 万</span></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:108271}}" alt="">优先：满 90 秒两轮腐化各交星界，腐化退后帮刷化身</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#talent">查看天赋 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="talent">
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">取自 +24 限时录像的元素天赋，英雄天赋先知。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-label">这四个防御与功能天赋不要动</p>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:381647}}" alt=""><div><b>位面旅行者</b><span>星界转移冷却缩到 90 秒，全本各高压点与两轮腐化全靠它排得开。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1279819}}" alt=""><div><b>始源羁绊</b><span>土元素不再嘲讽，改为最大生命值 +15%，专门补震地、释放电荷与蚀骨践踏空档。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:383013}}" alt=""><div><b>清毒图腾</b><span>2 分钟冷却，专清蝰蛇区剧毒蝰蛇的细胞毒素。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal"><img class="ic" src="{{I:355630}}" alt=""><div><b>风幕</b><span>风剪打断后 12 秒受到的法术伤害 −15%，全本大量自然与火焰读条都能吃到。</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-note">常见可换：<b>净化术</b> ↔ <b>强效净化术</b>（都用于驱暴怒云气积攒电荷）；<b>幽魂步</b> ↔ <b>阵风</b>；<b>大地之盾、元素环绕、塞拉赞恩的韧性、治疗链</b> ↔ <b>图腾集中、喷流、冰霜震击、静电充能、图腾潮涌、图腾投射、雷霆之爪</b>；另常驻配有<b>妖术、电能图腾、自然守护者、元素防护、生机盎然、恩赐之魂、狂风图腾</b>。</p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>元素萨满 · 塞塔里斯神庙 应对手册 · 2026-11</div>
    <div class="refs">参考录像：
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/HG7dTNB6MDVf8hzq#fight=1">孤独咩 +24 30:15</a>
